articularly by temperatures, heavy flooding and droughts.","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"Flow faces numerous domestic and international competitors, some of which have substantially greater resources directed to the vertical markets in which we compete. Competition focuses on brand names, product performance (including energy-efficient offerings and required specifications), quality, service and price. We compete by offering a wide variety of innovative and high-quality products, which we believe are competitively priced.","zh":null},{"en":"Effective January 1, 2026, we moved our residential and irrigation flow business from our Flow segment to our Water Solutions segment. As a result, the products previously within the residential and irrigation flow business are now part of the Water Solutions reportable segment. These products, including fluid transfer pumps, agricultural spray nozzles, as well as certain water disposal and water supply pumps, are used in various applications such as circulation and transfer, agricultural irrigation and crop spray. The residential and irrigation flow business includes brand names such as Berkeley, Hypro, Jung Pumpen, Sta-Rite and Shurflo. Given this change, the Flow segment will no longer serve wholesale and retail distribution customers in residential or agricultural markets. Additionally, the commercial and infrastructure flow and industrial solutions businesses have not historically b","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Pool","val":1558800000,"zh":"Pool"},{"name":"Flow","val":1553600000,"zh":"Flow"},{"name":"Water Solutions","val":1062099999.9999999,"zh":"Water Solutions"}],"total":4176000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":2938100000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Developing Countries","val":507800000,"zh":"Developing Countries"},{"name":"Western Europe","val":496000000,"zh":"Western Europe"},{"name":"Other Developed Countries","val":234100000,"zh":"Other Developed Countries"}],"total":4176000000}},"peers":["ROP","DOV","AOS","GWW","XYL"]}}